msgctxt "132"
msgid "Urk... We won't forget this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Thanks a lot, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "Nice job out there, Mikio."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "Oh, thank goodness you shut down those hoodlums!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"You know Nakahara-san, do you? Then this is for you. What do you think? "
"Pretty spectacular, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "It looks delicious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Giant Blue Parrotfish<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"Wow, Miki-chan, you can really hold your own! I knew we could count on you "
"to keep us safe!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "Right. With you watching over us, we can do business in peace."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Really? Well then, it's my pleasure!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"All right, Mikio. I'm heading out. Don't slack off on your patrol, now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "I won't! Thanks again, sir!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"Cut it out, before I make you cut it out! This is Ryudo Family territory!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "And what, you're one of them? Takes some guts to admit that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"Listen, this market's a real moneymaker, so we're gonna take it over as of "
"riiight now. You can run on home, tubby!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "Mikio!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "This is Ryudo Family territory! You stay the hell out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Yeah! The Ryudo Family takes good care of us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "We don't need your kind around here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "You wouldn't be doing this if Nakahara-san were here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Shut up, you senile old farts! I'll deal with you later!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Wait! They're not the ones you're after!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"Yeah, and neither are you! You wanna have it out with us, you bring "
"Nakahara. Got it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "That is, if you got the balls! Wahahaha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "You bastard..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid "Mikio. Don't take the bait."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "But sir, these guys⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "And who the hell are you?"
msgstr "Chi diavolo sei tu?"

msgctxt "552"
msgid "Just a passerby with a job to do. Ready, Mikio?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "Yeah! Let's give 'em hell, sir!"
msgstr ""

